<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Showbiz Pizza rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Showbiz Pizza rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said on Monday it has begun coverage of ShowBiz Pizza Time Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects stock price performance to be driven by continued strong gains in same-store sales, margin improvement and the possibility for upside surprises to earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- said forecasts company to earn $1.15/shr in 1997 and $1.40/shr in 1998.</p>
<p>-- stock up 1-25/64 at 21-49/64 by midday.</p>
</text>
